          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉલ્લંઘન (ullanghan) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit ullaṅghana, \"leaping over, passing beyond\" (Monier-Williams): stepping over a line one should not cross."
