              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉથાપવું (uthāpvũ) is inherited from a form CDIAL reconstructs as ut-sthāpyatē, \"is raised\"; CDIAL glosses the Gujarati verb \"to take down, to remove, to transgress\" (CDIAL 1904)."
